// Castle Graymantle layout (WP-064, part 1): greybox blocks (scaled `block_unit`, centered on
// `pos`). Y is up, +Z is north. The ground is 0 m except the gorge, the cliff path (-8 m), and
// the cistern (-8 m); see terrain.ron. Places, with extents (x, z):
//   the cliff plaza        x -70..70, z -90..0   L14 at (-12, -26); the arrival road; the
//                          trench stair down to the cliff path at (0, -18)
//   Graymantle Bridge      x -6..6, z 0..60      B03's arena. The deck's top is at 0, 1.5 m
//                          thick, on three pairs of piers; 1.3 m parapets; two pylons at the
//                          south end frame the fog gate (the plane z = 3.5)
//   the cliff path         x -2..2, z 2..58      a shelf at -8 m under the deck, with 0.7 m rock
//                          lips; the trench stair joins it at z 2 and the cistern closes it
//   the Barbican           x -32..32, z 60..114
//     cistern              x -14..14, z 60..92   floor -8 m, L15 at (-4, -8, 74); a stair at
//                          x 6..12 climbs to the courtyard at z 90
//     gatehouse            z 62..76              a tunnel x -4..4 closed by two doors in the
//                          bridge's north end (main gate and postern); the lever is inside
//     guard room           x 5..31, z 63..75     the east tower, door on its north face
//     forecourt            x -30..30, z 76..112
//   the Lower Ward         x -48..48, z 114..212 an inner arch at (0, 112); kennel (west),
//                          armory (east), chapel (north-east), a guard post, a wall-walk on the
//                          west wall (a ladder at z 130, a ballista at z 150, a drop to the
//                          item ledge at z 160..170) and the keep stair at x -6..6, z 196..212
//   the keep landing       x -6..6, z 212..224   y = 6 m; the stair climbs on (terrain.ron) to the
//                          third tier at z 240 (part 2, below)
// PART 2 (WP-065) stands on a terrace at y 12 (x -48..48, z 216..398), up to z 400:
//   the windward court     z 240..262   L16 at (-5, 245); perches x +-37..45 (y 16); curtain walls
//   the bastion + lift     x 9..29, z 190..216   a slab at y 12 over the Lower Ward, a lift cage
//   the keep               x -28..28, z 262..288   dining hall y 12, library y 18 (gallery y 22);
//                          the dining stair (x -26..-22) and the west rampart stair (x -34..-28)
//   the bell tower         x -21..-9, z 288..300   two turns round a well to the belfry, y 38
//   the corridor           x 17..25, z 288..322   down from the library's north door
//   the antechamber        x -8..28, z 322..340   L17 at (2, 330); B07's fog gate is z = 340
//   Castellan's Hall       x -22..22, z 342..384   the back gate at z 385 and its passage to z 398
// Colliders are axis-aligned boxes, so every doorway is a gap between two boxes plus a lintel.
// Walks between Lanterns are checked by world_state/castle_tests.rs.
(
